OL,3,GNEWSABake Off contestant applied for
OL,4,Ashow 'on a whim'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA contestant of the new series of the
OL,7,FGreat British Bake Off has said they
OL,8,Fapplied to take part "on a whim" after
OL,9,Fgetting "sick" of people urging them to
OL,10,Fapply.
OL,12,FTwelve new bakers will be introduced
OL,13,Fwhen the first episode airs on Channel
OL,14,F4 on Tuesday night, including Danni, an
OL,15,FHGV service centre administrator from
OL,16,FDorset.
OL,18,FOther contestants include a paediatric
OL,19,Fdoctor, a competitive sprinter, a
OL,20,Fhairdresser and a drag artist.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
